/* ── Body subtext: 16px on phones and small tablets ──
   Deliberately the last rule in this file. It overrides base declarations of equal
   specificity, so source order is what makes it win — several of the subs it names
   are declared later in the sheet than the comment that explains it, and placing
   this block anywhere but the end left those silently unaffected.

   16px is what the established sections do: .ih-sub is 19px stepping to 16px at
   this exact breakpoint, .pcta-sub walks 18 -> 17 -> 16. Base sizes are untouched,
