/* ── Focus rings for the ported slider controls ──
   .sa-ps-dot, .dt-ps-dot and the four .sa-ps-nav-* / .dt-ps-nav-* buttons are
   declared with `all: unset` in the approved sheets, and `all` resets `outline`
